{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><p>更新時間：02:20 2026-11-20 HKT<br/>發佈時間：02:20 2026-11-20 HKT</p>\n<p>發佈時間：02:20 2026-11-20 HKT</p><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/b0df9925b4f7664ed098e71bddb874c2/2026-11/2026-11-19_18_17_47.png\"/><p>長沙灣海麗邨發生有人暈倒事件。周四（19日）8時許，一名49歲姓鄭男子在海麗邨海賢樓寓所內突然暈倒，其兒子見狀隨即報案求助。</p><p>救護員接報趕抵現場，發現事主陷入昏迷，隨即將其送往明愛醫院搶救。</p><p>據悉，事主有身體病紀錄。</p><p>最Hit</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-19T18:42:16.496831+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":191,"images":1,"source":"星島頭條","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-19T18:20:36+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-19T22:57:51.365798+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-19T18:35:43.334773+00:00","content_hash":"b961a41d223f1fd369b8ac5bf8f68365ad7c89436abd818cd93905161a5dd422","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}